### 1. GET all books (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET book by existing id (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET book by missing id (404 Not Found - RFC 9457 ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/problem+json

### 4. POST create a valid book (201 Created + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Designing Data-Intensive Applications",
  "author": "Martin Kleppmann",
  "year": 2017,
  "genre": "NON_FICTION"
}

### 5. POST create a duplicate book (409 Conflict - RFC 9457 ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "year": 2008,
  "genre": "NON_FICTION"
}

### 6. POST create book with empty/invalid title (400 Bad Request - RFC 9457 ProblemDetail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Anonymous",
  "year": 2020,
  "genre": "FICTION"
}

### 7. PUT update an existing book (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java (3rd Edition)",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018,
  "genre": "NON_FICTION"
}

### 8. PUT update non-existing book (404 Not Found - RFC 9457 ProblemDetail)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "title": "Non-existent",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "year": 2024,
  "genre": "FICTION"
}

### 9. DELETE an existing book (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 10. DELETE the same book a second time (204 No Content - Idempotent)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 11. Individual Variant 2: Sorting and filtering (?sort=year,desc&genre=NOVEL)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?sort=year,desc&genre=NOVEL
Accept: application/json

### 12. Individual Variant 2: Unknown sort field (400 Bad Request - RFC 9457 ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?sort=price,desc
Accept: application/problem+json
